# Radiance on an Untap whose pump rides a SubAbility$ with Defined$ ParentTarget
# (Rally the Righteous): getRadiance walks up to the ancestor that targets
# (SpellAbility.getSATargetingCard), so the white Elite Vanguard untaps with the
# targeted Savannah Lions. The tapped green Grizzly Bears shares no color and
# stays tapped.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 R
tapformana human 3 W
tapformana human 4 W
queue targets 5
queue paygeneric W
queue action human cast 1
passpriority
